      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Your job is to steal as many energy cubes       as required by your home
    planet. \n\nFind the energy cubes and location of enemies\non the map located
    at the top right corner\nof the screen\n\nOn the Map, energy cubes are gold in
    color      and enemies \nare red in color\n\nonce you have taken enough energy
    balls a portal will open up at a random location. That portal is your exit\n\nThe
    portal is a green star on the map\n\nControls are:\nWASD or arrow keys for movement\nUse
    mouse to look arround\nHold Shift to sprint\n\nSwitch to Onscreen controls by
    using the \npause button        and switching from \nkeyboard to onscreen controls"
